{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_026_1000_023aka", "source_sha256": "a9482d2c7ac75f41d298688983760f90ad82c75fe522bd169518bb2175c3fab7", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}ちゃん発見！\n茜ちゃんのブログ、読んでくれた？", "zh": "啊！发现小{$P$}！\n你看过小茜的部落格了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_026_1001_p", "source_sha256": "131ee9aa0ae0ae140dab35fab1c9ae323ec5f373f2db43f65a72e62bd22d405f", "ja": "ああ、読んだよ。公演の後、あんなに\n疲れ果ててたのに、よく書けたな。", "zh": "嗯，我看了。\n公演结束后明明筋疲力尽了，你竟然还有力气写。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_026_1002_023aka", "source_sha256": "4e762d8ae7d43f9866f2c3881c7404b369dcf57040426b4482238c635f3e9983", "ja": "ふふん、まだまだ、茜ちゃんはこんなもんじゃないよ！\n茜ちゃんの本気に、限界はないのだー！", "zh": "哼哼，小茜的实力还不只这样喔！\n小茜认真起来，可是没有极限的──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_026_1003_023aka", "source_sha256": "f4c309c0ce0f64a97fc5c8b0e3b8e58ec9a3eaa1f0902dece85bed77597d1866", "ja": "こうしてる今も、{$P$}ちゃんが\nビックリするようなスゴい計画を進行中だからね！", "zh": "小茜可是同时暗中进行着会让小{$P$}\n大吃一惊的超强计划喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_026_1004_p", "source_sha256": "c50364d030d156ca9d91f67c7a98a7beec5ad2d420db83ef90eabc9b7277eddd", "ja": "ああ、確かにビックリしたな。劇場の隣に、\n茜ちゃんパビリオンを建てようとしているんだって？", "zh": "是啊，我真的大吃一惊。\n听说你想在剧场隔壁盖间小茜展示馆？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_026_1005_023aka", "source_sha256": "2db2da4cca1eda2a3a42225a72b699f8b3644b54ffef29c95fa7581fcc17898d", "ja": "ニャ！？　ニャ、ニャ、ニャ……\nニャんでバレてるの！！？", "zh": "喵！？喵、喵、喵……\n为什么会被发现喵！！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_026_1006_p", "source_sha256": "917b12a36a136cb09077143ea0ede9f7d0a35af601695037b7390c684bc64b5e", "ja": "事務所のパソコンで設計図を作ってたら、バレるって。\n律子がファイルを見たって言ってたぞ。", "zh": "你用事务所的电脑画设计图，当然会被发现啊。\n律子说她看到档案了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_026_1007_023aka", "source_sha256": "ad8bc40a74df773ed443d48b0ad3d9ca77f015c85f7c1c7891428b1589ecc0ae", "ja": "そんな！　ファイルを暗号化して、パスワードを\n間違えると自動削除されるようにしといたハズ……。", "zh": "怎么可能！？小茜把档案加密过，\n一旦输入错误密码，就会自动删除才对啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_026_1008_p", "source_sha256": "acb684671d6ed09d1a7fc8872061fa66a20ef83789b440c562cc00e39c4b8ae3", "ja": "ファイル自体を閉じ忘れてたら、\n意味がないんじゃないか？", "zh": "但你自己忘记把档案关掉，\n不就没意义了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_026_1009_023aka", "source_sha256": "18f4bd63ddac09e488032593d748f54b8d62c8e494982499089353e01defdf34", "ja": "ガーン！！！", "zh": "大受打击！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_026_1010_p", "source_sha256": "03c8717c7516f82c08577c9979d9894647b792bcd7b866980f4ede6abdea2fc7", "ja": "とにかく、律子がこの件で話があるから、\n後で事務室に来るように、だそうだ。", "zh": "总之，律子叫你待会过去事务室，\n想和你讨论这件事情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_026_1011_023aka", "source_sha256": "0d11b45ad4351030d4140f587a70e8ee2ea7956917e958db322c7b185353816b", "ja": "ニャー！？　ま、まずい、まずいよ！\nほとぼりが冷めるまで、しばらく姿を消さないと……！", "zh": "喵！？不、不妙，大事不妙！\n看来小茜得先消失一阵子，避避风头了……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_026_1012_023aka", "source_sha256": "d79ae3efdeb73801ab1805d1eac66430327dd69326e3aedc6fe8e8797d6b36f1", "ja": "{$P$}ちゃん！　突然だけど、\n茜ちゃん、しばらく旅に出るから！　またね！！", "zh": "小{$P$}！\n小茜突然要去旅行一阵子！再见！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "main_blst_026_jp.gtx", "item_key": "main_blst_026_1013_p", "source_sha256": "2dcffb2001c764a68809becd01ced1a103b8471ca8d7761980e369214566fa33", "ja": "やれやれ、また努力の方向を間違えてるな。\n……おーい、茜ー。逃げてもどうせすぐに捕まるぞー。", "zh": "真是的，她又搞错努力的方向了。\n……喂──茜，逃跑也没用的，马上就会被逮到喔──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
